WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:13.656
"Fish!" Jeremy cried.

2
00:00:13.656 --> 00:00:17.297
"Finally!" Tom said.

3
00:00:17.297 --> 00:00:19.205
He was happy.

4
00:00:19.206 --> 00:00:23.080
Soon they could look for the flowers!

5
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.946
Bump! Bump!

6
00:00:25.946 --> 00:00:28.400
Tom looked at the water.

7
00:00:28.401 --> 00:00:32.331
Small fish swam all around the boat.

8
00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:36.418
"They are minnows," Jeremy said.

9
00:00:36.418 --> 00:00:40.445
Tom did not have a fishing rod.

10
00:00:40.446 --> 00:00:44.833
But he had a paw.

11
00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:51.711
He swatted at the water.

12
00:00:51.711 --> 00:00:55.275
"No, Tom!" Jeremy said.

13
00:00:55.275 --> 00:00:58.192
"You will scare away all the fish."

14
00:00:58.192 --> 00:01:03.349
Tom frowned.

15
00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:11.154
Suddenly something pulled on Jeremy's rod.

16
00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:16.986
"Help!" Jeremy cried.

17
00:01:16.987 --> 00:01:21.375
Jeremy pulled hard on the rod.

18
00:01:21.376 --> 00:01:28.078
Tom pulled too.

19
00:01:28.078 --> 00:01:35.131
But the fish was very strong.

20
00:01:35.132 --> 00:01:38.446
"Ahh!" Tom cried.

21
00:01:38.447 --> 00:01:41.099
He almost slipped off the boat.

22
00:01:41.099 --> 00:01:47.042
Tom was getting tired.

23
00:01:47.043 --> 00:01:49.583
He wanted to rest.

24
00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:53.696
"One more time," Jeremy said.

25
00:01:53.697 --> 00:01:59.636
"Let's pull!"

26
00:01:59.637 --> 00:02:07.583
Tom and Jeremy pulled hard on the rod.

27
00:02:07.584 --> 00:02:13.349
Splash! Finally the fish popped out of the water.

28
00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:16.572
But it was not a minnow.

29
00:02:16.572 --> 00:02:20.176
This fish was shiny.

30
00:02:20.177 --> 00:02:22.952
It had sharp teeth.

31
00:02:22.952 --> 00:02:31.296
"It's a giant trout!" Jeremy yelled.

